# What a working copy of this repository generates locally, and should not commit.

# NHANES microdata and the NCHS linked mortality files. These are US government
# public-domain data, not redistributed here: reproduction/R/01_download.R fetches
# them from CDC on first run. They are large and they are not ours to ship.
reproduction/data/
*.rds
*.xpt
*.XPT

# LaTeX and R build litter
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/
_files/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
